{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ANY QUESTIONS? ",
  "tag": "section",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": [
      "*"
    ]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_aR0gkV8V6rdOpqNd",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Any questions? </h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_RuI6dlpUfLkjJq7X",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>We&apos;ve got answers</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_hKQxN30o1bCAyNzz",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>What does Lio taste like?</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Ul4oNRk850jS50Hc",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p> Think herbal tea, not soda. If you&apos;re used to vapor, Lio is lighter and more natural than you&apos;d expect. Not as sweet, not as heavy, just clean, flavoured air.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_lRXHuoRxX7QBohWw",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>What is Lio?</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Lz3xay2Wv9s1f1wo",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>A 0% nicotine flavoured air device that replaces the behavioral loop behind destructive habits. No chemicals, no vapor, no nicotine. Just natural plant-based aromas and your own breath.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_zwC2TT5JbhXGUy6J",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>How does it actually work?</strong> </h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_UfwpDTy6nZ8oxxDG",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Your habit isn&apos;t just chemical, it&apos;s behavioral. The hand-to-mouth motion, the deep breath, the immediate relief. Lio recreates that entire ritual through flavoured air, satisfying the pattern your body is actually craving. No nicotine needed.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_x1u7xax7nnJQjCFQ",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>How can something like this work?</strong> </h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_6dJhYxbe8XqHD2lB",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Because up to 80% of any habit is behavioral, not chemical. Lio targets that layer, the part patches and gum completely miss.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_1pFmMHDzdPamejWv",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Will it work for my habit?</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_09Bf4TzzHNQn1kAl",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio works for any habit driven by ritual and repetition, vaping, nail biting, stress eating, anxious fidgeting, mindless snacking. If your habit involves a repeated motion and an immediate reward, Lio works.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_AxxZ6MukmuvVJ6P8",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Is it safe?</strong> </h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_nnM55WmduEaRTQEG",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Completely. Multiple third-party toxicology reports. Pharmaceutical-grade aromatics from IFRA-certified EU farms. Zero nicotine, zero vapor, zero synthetic compounds.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_ppnxd4lqJ41LuYsm",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>How long does each core last?</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_pJjwm3ceBM3mYuag",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>10+ days per core. Each pack contains 3.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_FWli4ibI3PSMXx7C",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>How often can I use it?</strong> </h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_aPC3dJVJv9CVRue9",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>As often as you need to. Anywhere. Any time. No restrictions, no limits, no side effects.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_iRNWRpbJ2yb3king",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>What results can I expect?</strong></h3>"
